message: If you use this repository, please cite it as below.
title: "Range Estimation from Wrapped Multi-Frequency Phase Observations"
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Franklin
    email: franklinzhang1985@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/franklinzhang/multifrequency-phase-ranging"
url: "https://github.com/franklinzhang/multifrequency-phase-ranging"
abstract: >-
  Research notes on the first threshold of coherent range estimation from
  wrapped multi-frequency phase observations: two parallel MSE lines, the
  phase scale sigma_jump, half-window Ziv–Zakai bounds, unequal spacing, and
  engineering budget rules. Archived trials live under computation/.
keywords:
  - phase ranging
  - multi-frequency
  - threshold effect
  - Ziv-Zakai bound
  - wrapped phase
